12 Would any of your office staff be involved in running the LLP?
13 Swayne: No, not really. The LLP would hire its own staff, including the receptionist,
14 who would be the main contact point for those who email or call in by phone. Although I
15 guess I’d be available to answer any questions if a user of the forms wanted to contact
16 me.
17 Arbuckle: Give me an example of what kinds of questions you’re talking about.
18 Swayne: Well, I mean things that don’t involve my professional judgment, like where to
